                                <text x="437" y="198" text-anchor="end" fill="var(--color-ink-0)" fill-opacity="0.35" style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono Variable',monospace;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:0.14em;">IN SIX MONTHS</text>

